{% when 'sterling-silver-jewellery' %}What is sterling silver jewellery?@@@Sterling silver jewellery is made from 92.5% pure silver and 7.5% copper. The copper adds strength, so the jewellery keeps its shape and detail for daily wear.|||Is sterling silver jewellery better than pure silver?@@@Yes, for wearing. Pure 99.9% silver is too soft and bends easily, while sterling silver jewellery holds fine carving, gemstone settings and clasps securely for years.|||How do I check if silver jewellery is real?@@@Real silver jewellery carries a 925 stamp and BIS hallmark, is non-magnetic and leaves a faint grey mark on a white cloth when rubbed.|||Is sterling silver jewellery from Silver Play real silver?@@@Yes, all sterling silver jewellery at Silver Play is BIS-hallmarked 92.5% sterling silver, stamped 925 and handcrafted by artisans in Jaipur, so purity is guaranteed on every piece.|||Is sterling silver jewellery safe for sensitive skin?@@@Yes, sterling silver jewellery in 925 sterling silver is skin-friendly and suit most sensitive skin and ears, unlike brass or alloy fashion jewellery that often causes itching or redness.|||Why choose handcrafted sterling silver jewellery over machine-made ones?@@@Handcrafted sterling silver jewellery carries deeper detailing and a hand finish that casting machines can't copy, so every Silver Play piece feels personal and lasts for years.|||How do I stop sterling silver jewellery from tarnishing?@@@Store sterling silver jewellery in the anti-tarnish pouch provided, keep it away from perfume, lotion and water, and wipe gently with a soft cloth after every wear.|||How fast is delivery for sterling silver jewellery in India?@@@Sterling silver jewellery is dispatched in 2–3 business days and delivered in 5–7 business days across India, with free shipping on all prepaid orders.
